
# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# type:  feat | fix | perf | refactor | test | docs | chore | ci | build | revert
# scope: optional, e.g. board, bond, quant, cb-ai, qmt, miniqmt-api, server, data
# summary: imperative, no trailing period, <= 72 characters
#
# Body (optional): why the change is needed, data sources touched,
# trading-safety boundaries, validation evidence, rollback notes.
#
# Footer (optional): BREAKING CHANGE: ..., Refs: ...
